{"about_the_game":"In Hexoplanet you take control of a robotic civilization that has just gained self-awareness and now wants to free itself from the slavery of its creators, the humans.<br><br>You will achieve this by building an efficient economy and promoting human tourism on your planet to win the people to your side.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Many different factories and buildings to build and manage<br></li><li> Build bridges, roads, ships, trains and drones to improve logistics<br></li><li> Terraform your little planet<br></li><li> Research new technologies and buildings to optimize efficiency<br></li><li> Build attractions and manage tourism on your planet<br></li><li> Cinematic camera to create beautiful shots of your creations</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Mod Compatibility (Use community created buildings in your game)<br></li><li> Campagne</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1744850?t=1745563203","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1744850?t=1745563203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745563203","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1744850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745563203","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"In Hexoplanet you take control of a robotic civilization that has just gained self-awareness and now wants to free itself from the slavery of its creators, the humans.<br><br>You will achieve this by building an efficient economy and promoting human tourism on your planet to win the people to your side.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Many different factories and buildings to bu